WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.080
Welcome to The Summit Signal.

2
00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:05.120
You've discovered a hidden leadership challenge!

3
00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:07.640
A storm is moving across the mountain,

4
00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:09.360
and four teammates need to reach the

5
00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:12.960
signal station before the crossing becomes unsafe.

6
00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:15.600
Each teammate moves at a different pace.

7
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:19.360
You have nineteen minutes, one signal beacon, and a crossing that

8
00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:22.480
can carry no more than two people at a time.

9
00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:26.080
Remember, every crossing takes time, and someone

10
00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:28.160
may need to bring the beacon back.

11
00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:30.880
Your challenge isn't simply to get there first.

12
00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:34.560
It's to make sure everyone gets there. Think ahead.

13
00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:35.760
Work together.

14
00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:38.320
And remember— great leadership means

15
00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:41.360
no one gets left behind. Are you ready?

16
00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:42.560
Let's see what you've got!
